        <li><strong>Auto-applied seasonal banners:</strong> Providers like Hostinger, A2 Hosting, and ChemiCloud run time-limited sales (76%, 75%, 81% off respectively) where the discounted price shows up the moment you land on their pricing page. No code needed; the URL parameter or banner cookie carries the discount into your cart.</li>
        <li><strong>Direct-discount SKUs:</strong> RackNerd's Special Promos are individual VPS SKUs (1GB KVM at $21.99/year, 2GB KVM at $35.99/year) priced below the regular KVM catalog. No code required — you just order the special SKU.</li>
      </ul>
