      <h3>Are RackNerd special promos really discounted?</h3>
      <p>Yes — verified directly on my.racknerd.com Special Promos page on July 6, 2026. Each SKU shows the discounted annual price (1 GB at $21.99/yr, 2 GB at $35.99/yr, etc.) and the discount is applied at the cart stage with no code needed. The 90-day affiliate cookie means readers who sign up via the vpstier link get credit, and RackNerd gets the sale — both sides win.</p>

